      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-09-029\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19207]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>16. </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>ANC OF SINGLETON PREGNANCY CONCEIVED USING ART:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-table-scroll\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"mm-table\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:0pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:179.8pt;\"><col style=\"width:179.85pt;\"><col style=\"width:179.85pt;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Condition</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Incidence</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Recommendations</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"c99399d5cac01224a239a56e\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-09-029\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure c99399d5cac01224a239a56e\" viewbox=\"428625 123825 257175 361950\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"851c48a739f7984a33545c140d28e472b2f40632a09539a19569a1d8ab90bdb6\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-d0329aa99f68b16d39f4\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"d0329aa99f68b16d39f4\" transform=\"translate(556895 168275)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 6350 203200\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-d0329aa99f68b16d39f4)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>OHSS</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Risk of VTE</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">PIH</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">PTL</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Mild \u2013 33%.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Mod \u2013 severe 3.1 \u2013 8%.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Risk of VTE = 0.7 \u2013 10%.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Upper body &amp; arterial system after resolution of OHSS.</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Establish evidence based local protocols.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Admission to nominated centers.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Reporting to HEFA severe &amp; critical.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Miscarriages </p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">15 \u2013 20%</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Manage as spontaneous miscarriage.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Women should have access to specialist counselor before, during &amp; after ART.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Ectopic </p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">1.4%</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Same as miscarriage</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Careful inspection of adnexa on USG.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Be mindful of heterotopic pregnancy</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">PIH \u2013 more if </p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Age &gt; 35 years</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">BMI &gt; 30.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">PCOS</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Multiple pregnancy</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">2% more than natural conception</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">More in egg donation.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Sperm donation or</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Embryo donation.</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Risk assessment @ booking.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Aspirin 75mg from 12 weeks if risk Factor positive (not on basis of ART).</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">GDM \u2013 more in PCOS</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"c3dcecb0594359193d01697a\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-09-029\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure c3dcecb0594359193d01697a\" viewbox=\"600075 -76200 228600 285750\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"58b9f44c10ae1c14757ef15c87e10499013e179b9d41058ec7255d07aa0588c5\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-1976406e11e3d9b7dd1e\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#000000\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"1976406e11e3d9b7dd1e\" transform=\"translate(724535 8255)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(0 69850) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(0 -69850)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1 139700\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-1976406e11e3d9b7dd1e)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>1% </p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">ART not an indication of OGTT</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">VTE</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"6863a43eb8f5645268229638\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-09-029\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 6863a43eb8f5645268229638\" viewbox=\"1181100 28575 209550 152400\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"37ed4fe6bb0f849bcdba8e7ddc2ad1ab2c1fa3704c929176f889149d41e4d296\"><g data-mm-object-id=\"f8fdb45612078b5a91d0\" transform=\"translate(1207135 59690)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 95250 L 63500 0 L 127000 95250 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\" fill-opacity=\"1\" stroke=\"#223962\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>Highest in 1st </p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Alone ART is not an indication for prophylaxis.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Risk assessment.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Subclinical hypothyroidism</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"d2d123273ef1b38ba6a6dd69\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-09-029\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure d2d123273ef1b38ba6a6dd69\" viewbox=\"2085975 -9525 238125 295275\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"0b856104dabeea2d87f15e0cbc8201b1ec3ee39108bda4112d3b7d62de911965\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-19cabbb2ebc35ab31df0\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#000000\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"19cabbb2ebc35ab31df0\" transform=\"translate(2213610 43180)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1 132080\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-19cabbb2ebc35ab31df0)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>Treatment of subclinical hypo    es risk of miscarriage in ART pregnancies (limited evidence).</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:539.5pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Fetal complications</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Structural Anomalies</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"47229a9f5a987b66d8c5a38d\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-09-029\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 47229a9f5a987b66d8c5a38d\" viewbox=\"933450 -76200 228600 295275\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"9f608d3ac0eaeb0b5f70c6fc4369d9f4fa5912a596de09e54a3e91fb01f8ca1d\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-0f62d3f94961b5182f08\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#000000\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"0f62d3f94961b5182f08\" transform=\"translate(1054735 13335)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(0 63500) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(0 -63500)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1 127000\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-0f62d3f94961b5182f08)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>30 \u2013 40%     risk</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Oligospermia =&gt; Autosomal translocation or inversion 4.6 \u2013 13.7%</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Microdeletion = 5 \u2013 15%.</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Absolute risk</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">More in ICSI 6.5 \u2013 7%</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">No additional surveillance.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">IUGR:</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">ART minor risk Factor for SGA</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">No additional surveillance.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">S. B</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">2.4-fold</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Delivery @ Term IOL or C/Section</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">PTL </p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">11.2% iatrogenic </p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">No additional surveillance.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:539.5pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Placental complications</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Placenta Previa</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">More in blastocyst stage Transfer than @ cleavage stage.</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">No additional surveillance </p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Placenta Accreta</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">No additional surveillance</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Abruption</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">No additional surveillance</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Vasa Previa</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">If low lying placenta @ anomaly scan than TVS with Doppler to rule out Vasa Previa should be under taken.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19208]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##44546A; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><em>Table </em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##44546A; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><em>41</em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##44546A; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><em>. </em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##44546A; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><em>ANC OF SINGLETON PREGNANCY CONCEIVED USING ART</em></span></p>",
